---
source: crates/loom/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "loom_help(&[\"gate\", \"mint\"])"
---
Materialize gate findings into remediation work.

Usage: loom gate mint [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -m, --molecule <ID>     Promote deferred remediation beads for one molecule
  -w, --workspace <PATH>  Workspace root. Defaults to the current working directory
      --host-key          Explicitly allow ambient host Git credentials and signing config
      --tree              Run the standing safety-net sweep across the workspace
  -A, --agent <BACKEND>   Override the agent backend for this invocation [possible values: claude, pi, direct]
      --dry-run           Preview proposed mint writes without changing bd state
  -h, --help              Print help
